    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hub_txt",
      "x": 435,
      "y": 155,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "DECLARED FALLBACK CHAIN OPERATOR:\n\n\u2022 Tier 0: LIVE (Full API observation)\n\u2022 Tier 1: CACHED (Recent farm profile, <24h)\n\u2022 Tier 2: FORECAST (Open-Meteo GFS 7-day)\n\u2022 Tier 3: HISTORICAL_FALLBACK (District Mean)\n\u2022 Tier 4: PROXY (Phenology / Climatology)\n\nIdentical mathematical transformation\ngoverns BOTH Calibration & Inference",
      "originalText": "DECLARED FALLBACK CHAIN OPERATOR:\n\n\u2022 Tier 0: LIVE (Full API observation)\n\u2022 Tier 1: CACHED (Recent farm profile, <24h)\n\u2022 Tier 2: FORECAST (Open-Meteo GFS 7-day)\n\u2022 Tier 3: HISTORICAL_FALLBACK (District Mean)\n\u2022 Tier 4: PROXY (Phenology / Climatology)\n\nIdentical mathematical transformation\ngoverns BOTH Calibration & Inference",
      "fontSize": 14,
